WEBVTT

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:04.150
I'm Hoshizora Miyuki.

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:06.650
One day I met Candy the fairy,

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.290
and became a Precure legendary warrior.

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:12.620
My classmates Akane-chan,

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:14.020
Yayoi-chan

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:14.930
and Nao-chan

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:17.190
all transform into Precure, too.

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:19.060
There are five Precure all together.

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:21.970
Who could the last one be?

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:26.440
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:28.270
Smile Precure!

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:29.170
Let's go!

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.710
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:31.840
All together!

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:33.440
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.650
Jump to tomorrow!

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.320
Smile Precure!

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:43.150
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:48.590
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:53.800
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:59.740
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:04.680
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:04.640
So bright!

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:09.850
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:16.290
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:16.790
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:17.960
Let's go!

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:20.660
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:23.590
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:28.400
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:28.970
Girls! Let's go!

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:30.640
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:31.770
Everybody!

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.440
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:35.970
Fly to the future!

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:39.480
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:41.650
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:43.950
Smile Precure!

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:55.210
Wolfrun and Akaoni are pathetic!

00:01:55.210 --> 00:02:00.050
It's about time I, Majorina-sama, showed them how it's done!

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:14.430
I'm late! I'm late!

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:16.470
You say that every time-kuru!

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:18.100
That's not true!

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:30.220
Good morning, Hoshizora-san!

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:33.990
Aoki-san! You're so pretty, like a water sprite!

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:37.690
Do you water these flowers every morning?

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:38.390
Yes.

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:41.160
I love flowers, you see.

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:43.530
You mean, no one told you to water them?

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:44.800
That's right.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:49.130
But I think that if we have lots of pretty flowers, all the students will feel—

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:51.140
—ultra happy, right?

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.440
That's right.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:56.280
By the way, they say the early bird catches the worm, don't they?

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:57.910
What's that about?

00:02:58.940 --> 00:02:59.880
Oh, dear!

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.880
Let's go, Hoshizora-san!

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:08.350
“What a strange, demented feeling it gives me{TL: this is taken verbatim from the recognised translation of this classic, except for changing "realise" to "realize"}

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:12.490
when I realize I have spent whole days before this inkstone, with nothing better to do,

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:14.590
jotting down at random…”

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:15.960
That was delicious!

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.460
Nao! Use the Décor to dress me up-kuru!

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:19.830
You mean this thing from before?

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:21.000
Yes-kuru!

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.840
Let's go! Butterflies!

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:28.310
Put them on my ears-kuru!

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:29.410
Kuru!

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:30.340
Alright!

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.610
So cute!

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.550
I do my little sisters' hair every day.

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:40.150
Thanks-kuru!

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:41.420
Guys!

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:42.760
Listen up!

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:47.690
I think I might have found the fifth Precure!

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:48.830
Who?

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.030
The final Precure just has to be

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:52.430
responsible…

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.030
…smart…

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:56.870
…kind…

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:56.870
Kuru! Kuru!

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.810
Someone like a water sprite!

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.780
“Like a water sprite”?

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:04.640
What's that all about-kuru?

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:21.160
Aoki-san! That's amazing!

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:22.590
Hoshizora-san!

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:23.630
And the others, too!

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:27.400
I see now. Reika sure is very responsible…

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:29.070
…and kind to everybody…

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:30.970
…and very smart and studious.

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:33.940
So you see, Aoki-san…

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.310
We want you

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.040
to be a Precure with us!

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:41.080
A Precure legendary warrior?

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:43.180
Your story is very improbable,{Changed implausible to improbable since it flows nicer in the sentence}

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:45.620
but you don't appear to be lying to me.

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:47.650
We're not lying!

00:04:47.650 --> 00:04:50.220
We really are super heroes!

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.890
I don't think that's quite right…

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:54.990
Aoki-san, take a look at this!

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:58.730
Have you ever seen a creature as bizarre as this before?

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.630
How can you call me “bizarre”-kuru?!

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:02.740
It spoke!

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:06.270
That's a most unusual robotic doll.

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:07.660
I'm no doll-kuru!

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.240
So, do you believe us now?

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:13.510
It <i>does</i> appear that something mysterious is afoot.

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:15.410
Please, Aoki-san!

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.850
Please be a Precure with us!

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:24.120
I appreciate the thought, but I'm a little busy at the moment.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:27.390
I'm terribly sorry.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.960
Busy? With what?

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:37.040
Each year, the student council organizes a fairy tale reading

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.270
for the students at the neighboring elementary school. However…

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:41.810
Aoki-senpai!

00:05:41.810 --> 00:05:42.540
Vice President!

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:45.180
Allow me to introduce everyone.

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:48.610
This is our secretary Kurata-kun and our treasurer Terada-san.

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:49.480
Hello.

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:50.980
Vice President!

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:53.020
We just got a message from the president.

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:55.320
His fever is still high.

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:56.690
I see.

00:05:56.690 --> 00:05:58.690
What's wrong with the president?

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:01.190
His cold took a turn for the worse.{Editor: Haha, one less guy to try to contaminate this series *runs away*}

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:03.160
What will we do about tomorrow?

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.200
It's alright.

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.530
As vice president,

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:09.470
I'll pull us through, somehow.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:12.140
What do you do at this storytelling?

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:15.770
The four of us take on parts in reading a fairy tale.

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:19.340
We <i>had</i> planned to tell the story of Snow White this year…

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:20.710
Snow White?

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:22.920
That sounds fun!

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:24.820
I'm sure the kids will love it!

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.890
Thank you.

00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:30.120
All the kids are looking forward to it,

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:32.260
so I don't want to disappoint them.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.730
Hey, guys!

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:38.260
How about we help Aoki-san and the others?

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:39.900
Nice idea!

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:41.230
Instead of just reading,

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:44.440
we could use paper puppets or something! The kids will love it!

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:45.570
Great idea!

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:48.210
Yayoi's really good at drawing pictures!

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:50.740
I… I wouldn't say I'm <i>that</i> good…

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:52.210
Maybe we could do that!

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:54.480
We could draw different pictures on each side,

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:58.180
and turn them around to show the characters crying or laughing.

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.080
Great idea!

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:00.950
I'll do my best!

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.060
Aoki-san, what do you think?

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:05.490
It's a wonderful proposal,

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:08.030
but we couldn't burden you with all this.

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:10.030
Let's have them help out!

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:11.060
But, still…

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:12.330
Aoki-san!

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:15.730
Let's make everyone who comes tomorrow ultra happy!

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:18.970
You really don't mind doing this?

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:20.270
Of course not!

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:25.680
Well, then,

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:26.850
I'll accept your help.

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:27.980
Yay!

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:29.850
Alright, so how are we going to do this?

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:31.150
What kind of puppets will we make?

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:33.150
Maybe I could draw some backdrops on paper, too!

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:34.090
Nice idea!

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:36.450
I'll go fetch some cardboard boxes, too!

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.440
It's finished!

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:00.710
It's perfect!

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:01.950
They're really cute!

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:02.450
Yeah!

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:03.720
You guys are amazing!

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:06.390
Akane-chan's confetti is all fluttery!

00:08:06.390 --> 00:08:07.320
That's right!

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:08.750
I made them like fish flakes!

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.390
I see! How interesting!

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:12.220
The backdrop is really good!

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:13.690
Everybody…

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:18.330
I mean it:

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:19.870
thank you so much!

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:22.000
She's so polite!

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:22.840
Aoki-san!

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:26.310
The storytelling's going to be great, isn't it?

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:29.780
I hope everyone enjoys it!

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:32.280
Yes!

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:33.680
Oh, crystal!

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:37.720
Where is there much Bad Energy to be found?

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:42.020
So, Snow White is the key?

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:47.830
Beauty!

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:54.490
Candy!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.300
Hey, hey,

00:08:58.300 --> 00:08:59.970
so then my <i>Dragon Fire</i> just suddenly…{TL: lol.  Tell the girls about your "Dragon Fire"...  Japanese fans are like "wtf?" "is this sexual harassment?" "lol" about this line.  It sounds even more suggestive in the Japanese, but I think I'll leave it like this :/}

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:00.940
I'm nervous!

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:02.810
Relax! Relax!

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:04.970
It's time to start!

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:07.080
Wait!

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:17.290
Thank you for coming to today's storytelling.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:19.250
I hope you enjoy it to the end!

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:24.260
Snow White.

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:26.030
Once upon a time,

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:28.860
there was a princess called Snow White,

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:31.200
who was beautiful and fair as the snow.

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:32.740
With her rosy cheeks

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:35.770
and her hair as black as coal,

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:38.140
she was a most beautiful princess.

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:39.310
Oh, how pretty!

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.680
Snow White!

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.350
How pathetic!

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:48.950
This poison apple will teach you a lesson.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:51.690
…and then the empress said,

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.260
“Mirror, mirror, on the wall,

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:55.660
who is the fairest of them all?”

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:58.260
The mirror replied,

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:00.630
“The fairest is not you,

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:01.860
but Snow White.”

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:03.730
It's a real witch!

00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:04.630
Wow!

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.140
Now, you lot,

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:11.810
how about a delicious poison apple?

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:12.740
Who's that?

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:15.510
Wait, she just called it a poison apple, herself.

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:17.610
Are you looking after one of these kids?

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:20.020
Let me take you to your seat.

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:25.950
It's a lie that the story has a happy ending.

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:28.490
In truth, she comes to a Bad End!

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:30.490
Don't tell me she's…

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:31.930
The world!

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:37.300
May you be stained with the worst possible ending: a Bad End!

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:41.700
I'll blot out the pages where your future will be written!

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:47.110
She's giving the world a Bad End-kuru!

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:50.550
Is this…?

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:52.920
Boring!

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:55.450
Storytelling is stupid.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:56.950
Working this hard

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.290
is just pointless.

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:00.320
Reika!

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:04.760
The Bad Energy from these humans

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:09.800
is bringing back Pierrot-sama, the Emperor of Evil!

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:16.010
So she's with that wolf and oni?{#}

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:21.310
My name is Majorina.

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:23.910
I'm a witch from The Land of Bad Ends!

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:25.880
“The Land of Bad Ends”?

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:28.350
We have to make everyone better again!

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:30.190
Everyone transform-kuru!

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:32.520
So Precure…

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:34.160
…weren't just a dream!

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:39.930
Ready?

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:43.230
Precure Smile Charge!

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:43.970
Go!

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:46.440
Go! Go!

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:48.440
Let's go!

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.180
The light of the future,

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:34.920
shining bright!

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:38.120
Cure Happy!

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:43.030
Dazzling sun!

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.690
Hot-blooded power!

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:47.560
Cure Sunny!

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:54.340
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:12:56.010 --> 00:12:57.340
Cure Peace!

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:03.810
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:06.650
Cure March!

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:12.990
I really transformed again!

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:14.760
You're so cool, March!{TL: *nods*}

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:15.760
Rock!

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:18.160
Today's twinkling rock, paper, scissors hand is rock!

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:20.500
Peace! Are you going to play that <i>every</i> time?

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.100
If you beat me, you'll be super lucky all day!{TL: sounds legit}

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:23.970
Really?

00:13:23.970 --> 00:13:25.670
I chose scissors,

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:27.600
so I lost-kuru!

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:29.440
<i>Scissors?</i> That's supposed to be <i>scissors?</i>{Editor: Well duh, can't you tell by the way her tiny unanimated fur is split :P }

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:31.510
Having fun, are we?

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:35.240
Things are going to be different from now on!

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.150
She looks kind of tough!

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:39.550
Come out, Akanbe!

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:45.050
Akanbe!

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:48.290
I'll show you the power of a mirror!

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:50.690
<i>Akanbe!</i>

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:51.890
It multiplied!

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:54.260
What do you think?

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:56.930
Only one is the real Akanbe.

00:13:57.130 --> 00:13:59.640
Do you know which one?

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:02.270
Cleanse them with your Precure powers-kuru!

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:03.770
That's it!

00:14:03.970 --> 00:14:05.040
What's that?

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:06.510
<i>Spirit! Spirit!</i>

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:14.680
<i>Spirit!</i>

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.680
What's all this about?

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:17.890
Precure…

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:22.060
…Happy…

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:23.630
<i>…Shower!</i>

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:27.560
Did I get it?

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:30.900
You have a trick like that, eh?

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:31.970
But too bad!

00:14:32.170 --> 00:14:33.870
Wrong one!

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:35.940
No way!

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:38.440
I've used up all my power!

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:39.340
I'm exhausted.

00:14:40.180 --> 00:14:41.810
Oh, <i>bravo!</i>

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:43.280
Now it's my turn!

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:46.280
Precure…

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:51.550
<i>…Sunny Fire!</i>

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:55.620
I did it!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.530
Wrong one!

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:00.000
It's my turn!

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:04.100
Precure…

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:06.440
…Peace…

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:09.070
<i>…Thunder!</i>

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:13.240
Wrong one!

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:15.610
No way!

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:17.450
There are five left!

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:20.180
I can't tell which one it is!

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:21.320
Frontal attack time!

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:25.890
Precure…

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:30.460
<i>…March Shoot!</i>

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:35.530
How was that?

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:36.900
Wrong <i>again?!</i>

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:38.470
Kuru!

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:43.010
Well, <i>your</i> powers were useless.

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:45.710
Now it's <i>my</i> turn!

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:46.640
Akanbe!

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:50.310
<i>Akan—</i>

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:53.080
<i>—be!</i>

00:15:57.620 --> 00:15:59.320
No mercy.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.230
Snow White?

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.770
What's the point of this trash?

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:17.810
Aoki-san!

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:19.140
What?

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:20.280
Who are you?

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:23.110
We're just some passing-through Super Heroes!

00:16:23.110 --> 00:16:24.750
Kind of, but <i>no!</i>

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.650
Super heroes?

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:28.650
Kise-san said that yesterday…

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:29.620
Wait a minute!

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.290
Is that Hoshizora-san and her friends?

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.420
Sorry! I can't tell you that!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:34.890
You told her yesterday, didn't you?

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:38.890
It's you! The one who was doing that stupid storytelling.

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:43.300
Well, you can waste your time doing things like that.

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:46.600
And you made some silly little puppets, too, didn't you?

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:49.040
Don't make me laugh!

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:55.980
<i>Aoki-san!</i>

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:58.980
<i>Let's make everyone who comes tomorrow ultra happy!</i>

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:13.000
Akanbe!

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.460
Finish them!

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:19.130
Aoki-san!

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:23.710
I don't know where you came from,

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:26.080
but I must ask you to leave.

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:27.810
Run away, Aoki-san!

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:30.680
What an impudent girl!

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:32.110
Who do you think you are?

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:36.990
I'm the vice president of the student council of Nanairogaoka Junior High:

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:38.290
Aoki Reika!

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:44.330
As vice president, I won't ignore your violent behavior on campus.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:45.090
No,

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:49.630
I, Aoki Reika, won't let you get away with this!

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:53.600
No way!

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:57.040
What's going on?

00:17:58.710 --> 00:17:59.680
What's this?

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:02.610
You're the final Precure-kuru!

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:06.180
Put a Cure Décor into the Smile Pact,

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:08.880
and cry “Precure Smile Charge!”-kuru!

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:11.220
I don't understand a word of what you're saying,

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:13.090
but I'll do it!

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:18.060
Ready?

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:21.460
Precure Smile Charge!

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:22.770
Go!

00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:24.600
Go! Go!

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:26.840
Let's go, Beauty!

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:51.690
A gentle heart

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:53.400
as pure as the driven snow!

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:56.130
Cure Beauty!

00:18:59.230 --> 00:19:00.440
Cure Beauty!

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:02.910
All five Precure are here-kuru!

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:08.880
What's this?

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:11.650
There's still another Precure?

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:12.650
Akanbe!

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.050
Akanbe!

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:16.090
What?

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:18.220
Fight, Beauty-kuru!

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:19.460
Fight?!

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:20.760
Akanbe!

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:25.360
I see now.

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:28.200
When I transform, I acquire superhuman powers.

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:29.500
She's quick on the uptake!

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:35.100
However, you won't know which of the reflected mirrors is the real one!

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:36.440
Akanbe!

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:37.370
Akanbe!

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:38.540
Mirrors?

00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:45.280
You're the real one, aren't you?

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:51.850
That was pretty powerful, if I say so myself.

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:54.890
How did you know which was the right one?

00:19:56.390 --> 00:19:58.690
Mirrors reverse whatever they reflect.

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:02.670
Put simply, whichever one of these has its ribbon in a different place must be the real one.

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:03.800
I get it!

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:07.040
It seems you're not totally useless.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:09.510
But you're not good enough!

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:11.340
Use the Beauty Blizzard-kuru!

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:14.240
Put your power into the Smile Pact-kuru!

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:17.110
You mean this? Alright!

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:22.320
Now-kuru!

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:25.720
Precure…

00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:29.860
…Beauty…

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:32.290
<i>…Blizzard!</i>

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:40.070
Akanbe!

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:46.510
Precure!

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:48.610
This will be interesting!

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:52.550
I'm so very tired!

00:20:54.510 --> 00:20:55.520
What's this?

00:20:55.680 --> 00:20:57.790
Aoki-san!

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.140
It was a real success!

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:20.240
Looks like everyone enjoyed it.

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:21.210
Everyone…

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.880
Thanks so much

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:27.350
for everything today!

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:29.650
I…

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:33.190
…know I turned you down before…

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:34.690
…but would you mind…

00:21:34.690 --> 00:21:37.960
…if I joined you?

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:42.130
Yay!

00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:43.430
Of course you can!

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:45.200
I wouldn't settle for anyone else!

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:46.800
You're alright with having me?

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:48.700
You're fine!

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:51.570
You see, Aoki-san…

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:54.510
<i>…Reika-chan…</i>

00:21:54.510 --> 00:21:55.940
…I really like you!

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:56.750
Me too!

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:57.610
And me!

00:21:57.610 --> 00:21:58.550
And me, too!

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:00.920
Miyuki-san!

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:01.850
Everybody!

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:04.020
Let's work together!

00:23:44.460 --> 00:23:46.570
All the Precure are together-kuru!

00:23:46.570 --> 00:23:47.850
All right!

00:23:47.870 --> 00:23:50.800
Well then, let us hold a meeting to decide our next step

00:23:50.820 --> 00:23:53.850
Okay! First we need a catchphrase for the Five of us together!

00:23:53.870 --> 00:23:55.080
We also need a group pose

00:23:55.100 --> 00:23:56.780
I really want a secret base~

00:23:56.790 --> 00:23:58.570
That´s a lot of things! What to do...?

00:23:58.570 --> 00:24:00.950
Hey, we have more important things to worry about!

00:24:02.190 --> 00:24:03.490
Smile Precure!

00:24:06.970 --> 00:24:09.810
Find your ultra happy smile!

00:24:10.180 --> 00:24:22.670
{Sponsor}
